        },
        {
          "start": 36.1397,
          "end": 36.8976
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Morgens siehst du sofort, was offen ist… was überfällig ist… und was diese Woche reinkommt.",
      "start": 37.3563,
      "end": 43.3274,
      "segments": [
        {
